    CardDataService -->|secret read| AzureKeyVault
    TransactionActivityService -->|secret read| AzureKeyVault
    ReferenceDataService -->|secret read| AzureKeyVault
    FixtureLoader -->|fixture load| AzurePostgres
    CardDataService -->|table read| AzurePostgres
    TransactionActivityService -->|table read| AzurePostgres
    ReferenceDataService -->|table read| AzurePostgres

